<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $1</p>
<p>million Stuttgart men's clay-court tournament on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>3-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 9-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Albert Portas (Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>3-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 6-2 7-5</p>
</text>
